message: 'To cite package "betaLB" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'betaLB: Likelihood-Based Confidence Intervals for Regression Effect Sizes'
version: 0.0.0.9002
abstract: Generates profile likelihood confidence intervals for standardized regression
  coefficients (beta) and other effect sizes, including multiple correlation, semipartial
  correlations, improvement in R-squared, squared partial correlations, differences
  in standardized regression coefficients, and Cohen's f-squared, for models fitted
  by lm().
